  "description": "This receipt template represents a standard in-store purchase from an IKEA furniture retail location in Richmond, British Columbia. It includes the IKEA wordmark at the top, full store address and contact details, transaction date and time, itemized furniture and home goods purchases, subtotals, applicable GST and PST taxes, and a clearly stated grand total. The receipt also shows billing information, payment method (debit card), masked card number, reference and authorization details, barcode, and closing customer message. This template is suitable for furniture retail receipt libraries, mock transactions, expense documentation samples, and receipt generator tools requiring realistic, structured IKEA-style formatting.",
